WEBVTT

00:02:58.931 --> 00:03:00.788
they aren't equally important.

00:03:00.788 --> 00:03:03.533
So pay attention to the green box

00:03:03.533 --> 00:03:07.548
as I move forward.

00:03:07.548 --> 00:03:10.340
In seeking and identifying

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.357
employees with high potential,

00:03:12.357 --> 00:03:17.006
the potential to go to the top of organizations,

00:03:17.006 --> 00:03:20.400
the skills and competencies

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.380
that relate to that green box

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.753
are rated twice as heavily

00:03:24.753 --> 00:03:28.567
as those in the other two elements of leadership.

00:03:28.567 --> 00:03:30.637
These skills and competencies